# Production deliverables generated by `python hardware/kicad/export_production.py`.
#
# Outputs (all regenerable, gitignored):
#   oas-F_Cu.gtl, oas-B_Cu.gbl       Copper layers
#   oas-F_Mask.gts, oas-B_Mask.gbs   Solder mask
#   oas-F_Silkscreen.gto, ...gbo     Silkscreen
#   oas-F_Paste.gtp, oas-B_Paste.gbp SMT stencil
#   oas-Edge_Cuts.gm1                Board outline
#   oas-PTH.drl, oas-NPTH.drl        Drill files (Excellon, mm, decimal)
#   oas-PTH-drl_map.pdf              Drill map for human review
#   oas-NPTH-drl_map.pdf
#   oas-top-pos.csv                  SMT placement (DNP excluded)
#   oas-bottom-pos.csv               (empty — no bottom-side SMD on OAS)
#   oas-bom.csv                      BOM (LCSC field placeholder)
#   oas-jlcpcb.zip                   Bundle for JLCPCB web uploader
#
# When sending to fab: upload oas-jlcpcb.zip for the bare board, then upload
# oas-top-pos.csv + oas-bom.csv on JLCPCB's SMT quote page (or merge them
# into the same zip if their uploader accepts that this season).
